'''Razorback''' (イノワール, ''Inowāru'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Bore]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Razorback
|image = E 280.png
|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[The Spy Who Pet Me|Sub-chapter 33 - The Spy Who Pet Me]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Cheerful Heretic|Sub-chapter 17 - Cheerful Heretic]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
Razorback is designed to be almost unbeatable without [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]], having ''extremely'' high health, speed, DPS and attack rate. He also strengthens by 50% at 50% health.

==Strategy==
One [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Oda Nobunaga]] or two or more [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercats]] are enough to permafreeze Razorback. The number of Bombercats needed can be reduced to one if you use one "Freeze" Effect UP (M) or two (Sm) [[Cat Combo]]s. However, timing Bombercat is crucial in [[Taste of Success (Merciless)|Taste of Success]]. The [[Tackey]]s can wipe out your Bombercats before they even reach the frontline to freeze Razorback, who can push to your base and destroy it easily.

If you don't have Nobunaga or Bombercat to freeze him, Razorback is still beatable. Bring as many anti-Darks as it takes to keep the pressure on him, such as [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Cooldown Cat]], [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Cat Eastwood]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]], [[Pumpcat (Rare Cat)|Cat O'Lantern]], and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]].

