==Trivia==
*A [[wikipedia:Razorback|razorback]] is a common alias for some wild boars found in United States and Australia.
*Razorback's Japanese name, イノワール ''Inowāru'', is a portmanteau of the Japanese word for boar, 猪 ''inoshishi'', and the French word for black, ''noir'', which is spelled ノワール ''nowāru'' in Japanese. It may also involve 悪 ''waru'' (bad, evil).

